
=== Input ===
  FirstName: "Jan" <string>
  LastName: "Drabek" <string>
  EmailAddress: "jan@example.com" <string>
  YearOfBirth: 1990 <int>

=== Hydrate (PascalCase input → camelCase properties) ===
firstName: Jan
lastName: Drabek
emailAddress: jan@example.com
yearOfBirth: 1990

=== Dehydrate (camelCase properties → PascalCase output) ===
{
    "FirstName": "Jan",
    "LastName": "Drabek",
    "EmailAddress": "jan@example.com",
    "YearOfBirth": 1990
}
